      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i think i have a UTI or something... it burns when i pee and i feel like i gotta go all the time. i have some macrobid (nitrofurantoin) from a few months ago in my cabinet, is it okay if i just take 200mg twice a day for a few days to see if it clears up? also i have stage 3 kidney disease so i just wanna make sure thats fine.",
